{
  "id": 310001030,
  "name": "Jade Nether Serpent",
  "desc": "Autopuppets responsible for detaining and transporting Reverberations within the Censure Courts. Usually, they disguise themselves as antiques and only reveal their serpent form when approached. Sightings of them has declined over the years.",
  "desc_open": "This enemy has a <color=HighlightB>higher RES</color> to <color=Fire>Fusion DMG</color>.\n\nAfter each shift switch is complete at the Censure Courts, Jade Nether Serpents search for and absorb any Echoes left behind before transporting them to the Manifold Sanctum for storage. They also periodically remove residual Reverberations from the Censure Court, send them for neutralization within the Manifold Sanctum, before discarding the remnants into the abyss below Xuanfang Hold.\n\nPossibly due to the decline in the purging operations on Tacet Discords, sightings of Jade Nether Serpents across the Land of Xuanfang have become increasingly uncommon in recent years.",
  "rarity": 1,
  "element": 2,
